["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">或</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ある</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">某个；某些</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229895\">ある<ruby>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うところです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我会见到一个学生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あるいは</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">或者；要么...要么；也许；或许；可能；有的...有的...；有时...有时...</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226408\">ガスで<ruby>調理<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しますか、あるいは<ruby>電気<rp>(</rp><rt>でんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">用天然气做饭还是用电?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アルバム</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相册；唱片集</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"106212\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にアルバムを<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せてくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他给了我一张专辑。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">泡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">泡沫；泡；沫；皂泡；啤酒泡沫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225679\">くだける<ruby>波<rp>(</rp><rt>なみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>泡<rp>(</rp><rt>あわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>作<rp>(</rp><rt>つく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">⁇ 的波浪创造了泡沫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">合わせる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">配合（节奏、速度等）；合并；联合；结合；合计；面对；与（某人）相对；比较；核对；使遭遇（不幸的命运等）；并排放置；连接；重叠；混合；掺合；刀剑相接；格斗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233367\">あなたの<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わせなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把你的计划与我一致。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">哀れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怜悯；悲伤；悲痛；不幸；同情；哀愁；可怜的；令人同情的；悲惨的；凄惨的；哎呀；唉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74068\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>哀<rp>(</rp><rt>あわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れを<ruby>誘<rp>(</rp><rt>さそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>有様<rp>(</rp><rt>ありさま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她似乎会发出悲伤。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主意；计划；提案；建议；议案；草稿；初稿；预期；期望；书桌；台架</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200764\">どちらの<ruby>案<rp>(</rp><rt>あん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がよりよいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你认为哪个建议更好?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗記</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记忆；背诵；记诵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113050\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>会話<rp>(</rp><rt>かいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>暗記<rp>(</rp><rt>あんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しようとした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他试图把这段谈话记录下来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">稳定；稳固；一致；平衡；均衡；镇定；（物理、化学）稳定的；处于稳态的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110189\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>安定<rp>(</rp><rt>あんてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>失<rp>(</rp><rt>うしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他失去了稳定,倒下了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんなに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那么；那样地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229563\">あんなに<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るなんて<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们不像这么生气。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんまり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">剩余；残余；剩下的；余数；盈余；饭菜剩余；不很；不太；不怎么；太；过于；过分；极端的；巨大的；严重的；惊人的；可怕的；不太好；马马虎虎；平庸的；以上；超过</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221356\">この<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあまり<ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这本书不读得太多。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">胃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">い</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">胃；胃部；胃宿（二十八宿之一）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"145782\"><ruby>食物<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくもつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>胃<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>消化<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>される。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">食物在胃中消化。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">委員</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いいん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">委员</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191120\"><ruby>委員<rp>(</rp><rt>いいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>全員<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>その<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>賛成<rp>(</rp><rt>さんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">众议员都赞成该计划。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いえ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不；没有；不用谢；别客气；不足挂齿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意外</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意外；出人意料；令人惊讶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"178712\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にここで<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うのは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>意外<rp>(</rp><rt>いがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我很惊讶能在这里见到你。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">息</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">呼吸；协调；和谐；默契；水汽；蒸气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227550\">おぼれかけた<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>息<rp>(</rp><rt>いき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>吹<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沉默的人呼吸回来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">行き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">去程；往程；出发段；开往…；前往…；去程票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">勢い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いきおい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">气势；势头</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">勢</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">生き物</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いきもの</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">生物；活物；动物；生命体</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144530\"><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>意識<rp>(</rp><rt>いしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のある<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人是有意识的生物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いけない</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坏的；错误的；淘气的；不可以；不应该；不许；无用的；没用的；不好的；没希望的；无可救药的；遗憾的；可惜的；不能喝酒的；不胜酒力的；以免；免得；生怕；唯恐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79353\"><ruby>友人<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>助<rp>(</rp><rt>たす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わなければいけない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">朋友必须互相帮助。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">医師</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">医生；医师</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110078\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>医師<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるために<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>している。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他正在学习成为医生。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意志</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意志；意愿；决心</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"156183\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>辞職<rp>(</rp><rt>じしょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>意志<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまったくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我一点也没有要辞职的意思。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/461610\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意思</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意图；愿望；目的；心意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144288\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>互<rp>(</rp><rt>たが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いに<ruby>言葉<rp>(</rp><rt>ことば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>意思<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>つう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人们互相说话,互相说话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">意識</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いしき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意识；知觉状态；意识到；察觉；感知；意识（佛教用语，六识之一，指对感觉信息进行认知的心识）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"223927\">このお<ruby>料理<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、パリのエスプリを<ruby>意識<rp>(</rp><rt>いしき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して、<ruby>味付<rp>(</rp><rt>あじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けしてみました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个菜,我认识到巴黎的埃斯普里,尝试了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">維持</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" d