li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いずれ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">哪个；哪里；谁；全部；两者；无论如何；总之；总之；迟早；总有一天；不久；最终</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144322\"><ruby>人間<rp>(</rp><rt>にんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいずれ<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぬのだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">人一定会死的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">以前</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">以前；之前；……前；过去；以往；先前；往日</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91347\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はもはや<ruby>以前<rp>(</rp><rt>いぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她不再是以前的女朋友。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">板</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いた</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">板；木板；金属板；玻璃板；玻璃窗格；石板；砧板；菜板；（高级日料）厨师；料理人；舞台；戏台</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220451\">この<ruby>鉄<rp>(</rp><rt>てつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>板<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすずでメッキしてある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个铁板是很干净的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いたずら</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb